@brief
Software Engineering and Computer Science Course.
(3 years | 3,024 hours (on going) | Berlin and Barcelona)

---

@curriculum
Through 16 projects and 5 exams, the core curriculum is designed for the development of a Software Engineer:
- Data Structures in C (Linked Lists, Binary trees and Hash Tables);
- Algorithms in C (Recursive Backtracking, Sorting and Searching, Graph, Dynamic|Greedy and Concurrent);
- System Process in Unix (VM, Containers, Pipes, Threads, Mutex, Sempahores);
- Network Architecture and Web Servers;
- Computer Graphics and Games in C and X11;
- Object-Oriented with C++; and
- Full Stack Web Development (PHP and Typescript).

